{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q021", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "prose_malai_idappeyargal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "korkai_pearl_trade", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க காலத்தில் கொற்கைத் துறைமுகம் எதற்குப் புகழ்பெற்ற உலகளாவிய வர்த்தக மையமாக விளங்கியது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முத்துக்குளித்தல் (கொற்கை முத்து)", "B": "மிளகு வர்த்தகம் மட்டுமே", "C": "தங்கச் சுரங்கம்", "D": "யானைத் தந்தம் மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "பாண்டிய நாட்டின் கொற்கைத் துறைமுகம் உலகப் புகழ்பெற்ற முத்து வணிகத்திற்கும் முத்துக்குளித்தலுக்கும் தலையாய இடமாக விளங்கியது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the classical Sangam era, for what global marine commodity was the Pandyan port of Korkai internationally renowned?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pearl fishery and trade (Korkai Pearls)", "B": "Black pepper commerce exclusively", "C": "Gold mining", "D": "Ivory carving solely"}, "explanation": "Korkai was globally legendary for its maritime pearl fisheries."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 47, "chapter": null, "section