{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q028", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "prose_malai_idappeyargal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "balakrishnan_civil_service_achievement", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆர். பாலகிருஷ்ணன் இந்திய ஆட்சிப் பணித் தேர்வை முதன்முதலில் எந்த மொழியில் எழுதி தேர்ச்சி பெற்ற முன்னோடி அதிகாரி ஆவார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சமஸ்கிருதம்", "B": "ஆங்கிலம்", "C": "இந்தி", "D": "தமிழ் (தமிழில் தேர்வு எழுதி வென்றவர்)"}, "explanation": "சிவில் சர்வீசஸ் முதன்மைத் தேர்வைத் தமிழ் வழியிலேயே எழுதி வெற்றி பெற்ற முன்னோடித் தமிழ் ஆளுமை ஆர். பாலகிருஷ்ணன் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which language medium did R. Balakrishnan achieve pioneering distinction by clearing the prestigious Civil Services Main examination?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sanskrit", "B": "English", "C": "Hindi", "D": "Tamil (Pioneering candidate writing in Tamil)"}, "explanation": "R. Balakrishnan was one of the trailblazers who cracked the IAS examination writing in the Tamil language."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page":