{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q054", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "poem_kaavadichindu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vettuvan_kovil_sculpture", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கழுகுமலையில் அமைந்துள்ள வெட்டுவான் கோயில் தமிழக வரலாற்றில் எவ்வாறெல்லாம் புகழப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தென்னகத்துக் காசி", "B": "தென்னகத்து எல்லோரா (The Ellora of the South)", "C": "தென்னகத்து ஹம்பி", "D": "தென்னகத்துக் கோனார்க்"}, "explanation": "ஒரே பெருங்கற்பாறையைக் குடைந்து செதுக்கப்பட்ட அற்புதக் கலைப்படைப்பான கழுகுமலை வெட்டுவான் கோயில் 'தென்னகத்து எல்லோரா' எனப் புகழப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "By what celebrated architectural comparison is the monolithic Vettuvan Kovil of Kazhugumalai hailed in Indian art history?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The Kashi of the South", "B": "The Ellora of the South", "C": "The Hampi of the South", "D": "The Konark of the South"}, "explanation": "Vettuvan Kovil is famously lauded as the 'Ellora of the South' for its exquisite rock-cut craftsmanship."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "202