{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q068", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "poem_kurunthogai_purananooru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "noble_virtues_list", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "புறநானூற்றுப் பாடலில் சான்றோர்கள் எதனைப் பெறுவதாயின் உலகத்தையே கொடுத்தாலும் கொள்ள மாட்டார்கள்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொன் பொருள்", "B": "அரசாட்சி", "C": "அமிழ்தம்", "D": "பழி தரும் இழிசெயல் (பழியெனின் உலகுடன் பெறினும் கொள்ளலர்)"}, "explanation": "புகழ் வருமென்றால் தம் உயிரையும் தருவர்; ஆனால் இழிவான பழி வருமென்றால் உலகத்தையே பரிசாகத் தந்தாலும் சான்றோர் ஏற்க மாட்டார்கள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Purananooru 182, what will noble souls refuse to accept even if offered the entire universe as a gift?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Gold and jewels", "B": "Imperial kingship", "C": "Ambrosia", "D": "Dishonor and blameworthy deeds (Pazhiyenin ulagudan perinun kollalar)"}, "explanation": "Great souls refuse dishonorable shame even if the entire universe is given in barter."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 51,