{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q069", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "poem_kurunthogai_purananooru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "meaning_annal_thakaimaiyar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அன்ன மாட்சி அனையர் ஆகித் / தமக்கென முயலா நோன்தாள்...’ - ‘நோன்தாள்’ என்பதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வலிமை மிகுந்த முயற்சி (விடாமுயற்சி)", "B": "மென்மையான கால்", "C": "அழகிய முகம்", "D": "இனிய பாடல்"}, "explanation": "நோன்தாள் என்றால் துன்பத்தைப் பொறுத்துக் கொண்டு இடைவிடாது உழைக்கும் 'வலிமையான விடாமுயற்சி' என்று பொருள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the verse 'Thamakkana muyalaa noanthaal', what does the classical compound 'Noanthaal' signify?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Enduring strength / unyielding industrious exertion (Perseverance)", "B": "Delicate feet", "C": "Fair visage", "D": "Sweet lyrics"}, "explanation": "'Noanthaal' signifies indomitable fortitude and relentless industrious exertion for human welfare."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 51, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference":