{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q081", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "poem_kurunthogai_purananooru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kurunthogai_27_tree_reference", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘கழனி மாஅத்து விளைந்து உகு தீம்பழம்...’ என்ற குறுந்தொகைப் பாடலில் ‘மா’ என்பது எந்த மரத்தைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மாமரம் (Mango tree)", "B": "மாதுளை", "C": "மருத மரம்", "D": "மகிழ மரம்"}, "explanation": "கழனி மாஅத்து என்பதில் 'மா' என்பது வயல் வரப்பில் நின்று இனிய மாம்பழங்களைத் தரும் மாமரத்தைக் குறிக்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kurunthogai verse 'Kazhani maathu vilainthu ugu theempazham', what botanical tree does 'Maa' denote?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mango tree (Mangifera indica)", "B": "Pomegranate tree", "C": "Marutham tree (Terminalia arjuna)", "D": "Magizham tree"}, "explanation": "'Maa' refers to the sweet mango tree growing beside the fertile agricultural rice fields."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 50, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, U