{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q105", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "supplementary_vaadivaasal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vaadivaasal_realism", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘வாடிவாசல்’ குறுநாவலின் தனித்துவமான உரைநடை பாணி எத்தகையது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வட்டார வழக்குச் சொற்களும், நேரடி கள யதார்த்தமும் நிறைந்த வீரியமான நடை", "B": "அதிபுனைவு நடை", "C": "வடமொழி கலந்த மணிப்பிரவாள நடை", "D": "மொழிபெயர்ப்பு நடை"}, "explanation": "தென்மாவட்ட கிராமத்து வட்டாரச் சொல்லாட்சியும், நேரடிக் கள அனுபவ வர்ணனைகளும் வாடிவாசல் நாவலை உயிருள்ள கலைப்படைப்பாக மாற்றுகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What distinctive stylistic prose quality elevates the literary realism of the novella 'Vaadivaasal'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vibrant dialectal diction combined with visceral, graphic eyewitness realism", "B": "Fantasy escapism", "C": "Sanskritized Manipravala style", "D": "Stilted translation tone"}, "explanation": "Visceral realism and rustic regional idioms bring the dust and danger of the arena alive."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", 