{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q145", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_iyal3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "theeyinaal_vaetrumai_ani", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘தீயினாற் சுட்டபுண் உள்ளாறும் ஆறாதே / நாவினாற் சுட்ட வடு’ - இக்குறளில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமை அணி (முதலில் ஒப்பிட்டு, பின்னர் வேறுபடுத்திக் காட்டுவது)", "B": "உவமையணி", "C": "எடுத்துக்காட்டு உவமையணி", "D": "பிறிது மொழிதல் அணி"}, "explanation": "தீயினால் ஏற்பட்ட புண்ணும் நாவினால் ஏற்பட்ட புண்ணும் முதலில் சுடுதல் தொழிலால் ஒன்றாகக் கூறப்பட்டு, பின் தீப்புண் ஆறும் நாவினால் சுட்ட வடு ஆறாது என வேறுபடுத்திக் காட்டப்பட்டதால் இது வேற்றுமை அணியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What poetic figure of speech (Ani) is exemplified in 'Theeyinaar suttapun ullaarum aaraathe naavinaar sutta vadu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaetrumai Ani (Contrastive / Disparity figure showing underlying divergence after initial comparison)", "B": "Uvamai Ani", "C": "Eduthukkaattu Uvamai Ani", "D": "Pirithu Mozhithal Ani"}, "explanation": "Vaetrumai Ani highlights contrast: physical fire-burns heal, but wounds inflicted by a scalding tongue never scar over."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 3", "Thirukkural", "Figure of Speech"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q146", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_iyal3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "oppuravu_wealth_purpose", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘தாள்ஆற்றித் தந்த பொருளெல்லாம் தக்கார்க்கு / வேளாண்மை செய்தற் பொருட்டு’ - ‘வேளாண்மை’ என்ற சொல்லின் குறள் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நிலத்தை உழுவது மட்டுமே", "B": "உதவி செய்தல் (ஈகை / பிறர்க்கு உதவுதல்)", "C": "பயிர் நடுதல்", "D": "தானியங்களை விற்பனை செய்தல்"}, "explanation": "இக்குறளில் 'வேளாண்மை' என்பது நிலத்தை உழுவதைக் குறிக்காமல், 'பிறருக்கு உதவி செய்தல்' (உபகாரம் செய்தல்) என்ற பொருளில் ஆளப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the couplet 'Thalaatrit thantha porulellam thakkaarkku velaanmai seithar poruttu', what is the exact classical meaning of 'Velaanmai'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Plowing agrarian topsoil exclusively", "B": "Benevolent assistance, altruistic charity, and helping the deserving", "C": "Paddy transplantation", "D": "Grain commerce"}, "explanation": "'Velaanmai' here specifically denotes selfless social service and benevolent charity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 3", "Thirukkural", "Vocabulary Semantics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q147", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_iyal3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ooruni_simile", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஊருணி நீர்நிறைந் தற்றே உலகவாம் / பேரறிவாளன் திரு’ - பேரறிவாளனின் செல்வத்திற்கு வள்ளுவர் காட்டும் உவமை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாலைவன மணல்", "B": "கடல் நீர்", "C": "ஊர் மக்கள் அனைவருக்கும் தாகம் தீர்க்கும் ஊருணியில் நீர் நிறைவது", "D": "மழையில்லாத மேகம்"}, "explanation": "உலகினர் மீது அன்பு கொண்ட பேரறிவாளன் சேர்க்கும் செல்வம், ஊர் மக்கள் அனைவருக்கும் குடிநீர் வழங்கும் ஊருணி நீர் நிறைவதைப் போன்றது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Ooruni neer nirainthatre ulagavaam perarivaalan thiru', what analogy illustrates the wealth of a wise benefactor?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Desert sand", "B": "Saline ocean water", "C": "A village drinking-water reservoir (Ooruni) brimming full for all inhabitants", "D": "A rainless cloud"}, "explanation": "A benevolent wise person's wealth is like a village drinking tank overflowing for universal public benefit."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 3", "Thirukkural", "Simile"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q148", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_iyal3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "payanmaram_simile", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘பயன்மரம் உள்ளூர்ப் பழுத்தற்றால் செல்வம் / நயனுடை யான்கண் படின்’ - நயனுடையானின் செல்வத்திற்கு எதனை உவமையாக்குகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முள்ளு மரம்", "B": "காய்ந்த மரம்", "C": "காட்டு மரம்", "D": "ஊரின் நடுவே உள்ள பயன் தரும் மரத்தில் பழங்கள் பழுத்துக் குலுங்குவது"}, "explanation": "பிறர்க்கு உதவும் நற்பண்பாளனிடம் சேரும் செல்வம், ஊருக்கு நடுவில் உள்ள பயன்மரம் பழுத்து அனைவருக்கும் கனிகளைத் தருவது போன்றதாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Payanmaram ulloorp pazhuthatraal...', to what is the wealth of a benevolent soul compared?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thorn bush", "B": "Withered trunk", "C": "Dense wilderness tree", "D": "A fruit-bearing tree fruiting in the center of a town offering sweet sustenance freely to all"}, "explanation": "Wealth belonging to a generous human is like a fruit tree bearing ripe fruit right inside the village."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 3", "Thirukkural", "Payanmaram"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q149", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_iyal3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "marunthaagi_thappaa_maram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மருந்தாகித் தப்பா மரத்தற்றால் செல்வம் / பெருந்தகை யான்கண் படின்’ - பெருந்தகையாளனின் செல்வம் எவ்வாறு பயன்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தன் பட்டை, இலை, வேர் என எல்லா உறுப்புகளாலும் மருந்தாகி உதவும் மரத்தைப் போல எல்லார்க்கும் எல்லாவிதத்திலும் பயன்படுகிறது", "B": "தனக்கு மட்டுமே மருந்தாகிறது", "C": "வீணாக அழிகிறது", "D": "பிறர் தொட முடியாதபடி ஆகிறது"}, "explanation": "பெருந்தகையாளனிடம் உள்ள செல்வம், தன் அனைத்துப் பாகங்களாலும் மனிதரின் பிணி போக்கும் மருத்துவ மரத்தைப் போல அனைவருக்கும் பயன்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How does the wealth of a noble soul function according to 'Marunthaagith thappaa marathatraal...'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Like a healing medicinal tree whose roots, bark, leaves, and sap cure every ailment without fail for the whole public", "B": "Heals only its owner", "C": "Decays wastefully", "D": "Remains inaccessible"}, "explanation": "Noble wealth is like an infallible medicinal tree that yields cures through its every part."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 3", "Thirukkural", "Medicinal Tree Simile"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q150", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_iyal3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "eethal_isaipada_vaazhthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஈதல் இசைபட வாழ்தல் அதுவல்லது / ஊதியம் இல்லை உயிர்க்கு’ - மனித உயிருக்கு இதைவிட சிறந்த லாபம் வேறு இல்லை என்று வள்ளுவர் எவற்றைக் கூறுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பணம் சேர்த்தல், அரண்மனை கட்டுதல்", "B": "ஏழைகளுக்குக் கொடுத்து உதவுதலும், அதனால் உலகப் புகழோடு வாழ்தலும்", "C": "போர் புரிதலும் நிலம் வெல்லுதலும்", "D": "தனிமையில் இருத்தலும் நூல்கள் படித்தலும்"}, "explanation": "இல்லாதார்க்கு ஈந்து மகிழ்வதும், அதனால் அழியாத புகழுடன் வாழ்வதும் தவிர மனித உயிருக்கு இதைவிடப் பெரிய ஊதியம் வேறு எதுவும் இல்லை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to 'Eethal isaipada vaazhthal...', what constitutes the ultimate enduring profit of human existence?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Hoarding gold and constructing fortresses", "B": "Generous giving (Eethal) and living adorned with untarnished renown (Isaipada)", "C": "Waging wars and imperial expansion", "D": "Reclusive isolation"}, "explanation": "Giving to the destitute and living with honor is the highest conceivable gain of human birth."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 3", "Thirukkural", "Pugazh"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q151", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_iyal3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vasai_ozhiya_vaazhvaare", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘வசையொழிய வாழ்வாரே வாழ்வார் இசையொழிய / வாழ்வாரே வாழா தவர்’ - வள்ளுவர் பார்வையில் உண்மையில் வாழ்பவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நீண்ட காலம் உயிர் வாழ்பவர்", "B": "செல்வந்தராக வாழ்பவர்", "C": "தன் மீது எவ்விதப் பழியும் இல்லாமல் புகழ் பெற வாழ்பவர்", "D": "அதிகாரம் செய்பவர்"}, "explanation": "பழி இல்லாமல் புகழோடு வாழ்பவரே உண்மையில் வாழ்பவர்; புகழ் இல்லாமல் வாழ்பவர் உயிரோடு இருந்தாலும் இறந்தவருக்குச் சமம்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Vasaiyozhiya vaazhvaarae vaazhvaar...', who is truly regarded as living according to Valluvar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "One who survives to old age", "B": "One who lives in luxury", "C": "One who lives untainted by blameworthy shame and crowned with noble renown", "D": "One who exercises despotic power"}, "explanation": "Those who live free from slander and renowned for virtue truly live; the rest merely breathe."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": 