{"id": "11th_tamil_u3_q160", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_iyal3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "parimelazhagar_commentary_adakkam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அடக்கம் அமரருள் உய்க்கும்’ குறளுக்குப் பரிமேலழகர் தரும் உரையில் ‘ஆர்இருள்’ என்பது எதனைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இரவு நேரம்", "B": "அடர்ந்த காடு", "C": "சூரிய கிரகணம்", "D": "நீங்காத கொடுந்துன்பம் தரும் நரகம் (அளறு)"}, "explanation": "ஆர்இருள் என்பதற்குப் பரிமேலழகர் ‘நீங்காத பெருந்துன்பத்தை உடைய நரகம்’ என்று உரை வரைந்துள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In classical commentator Parimelazhagar's exposition of 'Adakkam amararul...', what does 'Aarirul' specifically designate?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Midnight darkness", "B": "Deep jungle", "C": "Solar eclipse", "D": "The hell of impenetrable eternal darkness and anguish (Alaru / Naraka)"}, "explanation": "Parimelazhagar interprets 'Aarirul' as the abyss of eternal punitive suffering."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section":